This Terraform program creates an Elastic Beanstalk application named `my-app` with an application version lifecycle using the `aws_iam_role` for the service role. It also sets up an S3 bucket and object to store the application version, which is then used to create the application version in Elastic Beanstalk. The bucket and object are given realistic offline-valid names and tags.

