This Terraform program creates an AWS Connect instance with SAML identity management enabled, along with an S3 bucket, Route53 zone, and a bot association. The S3 bucket is used as a placeholder for the actual SAML configuration, which would typically be set up separately. The bot association is configured to associate the bot named "example-bot" with the Connect instance.

