This Terraform script defines the necessary AWS resources to set up an EKS cluster with pod identity management. It includes an IAM policy document for assuming a role by EKS pods, an IAM role using this policy, a policy for S3 read-only access, and an EKS pod identity association linking the role to a specific EKS cluster, namespace, and service account. The script uses default values for the EKS cluster, namespace, and service account names, and creates them if they do not exist.

