This Terraform program creates the necessary AWS resources to implement the described web server that allows users to upload cat pictures and provides random cat pictures on demand. It includes DynamoDB for storing metadata, S3 for storing uploaded pictures, Lambda for handling file uploads and updating DynamoDB, API Gateway for exposing the service, and IAM roles for managing access. The program uses default values for AWS identifiers and resources where possible, ensuring that it can be deployed with Terraform ~> 1.9.8 and hashicorp/aws ~> 5.75.

